<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="th">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Module 4 — SCM · Inventory · Lean · ERP</title>
<style>
@import url('https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Sarabun:wght@300;400;600;700;800&family=Kanit:wght@400;600;700;800&family=IBM+Plex+Mono:wght@400;600&display=swap');
:root {
  --teal:#0f766e;--teal2:#0d9488;--teal3:#14b8a6;--teal-soft:#ccfbf1;
  --amber:#d97706;--amber2:#f59e0b;--amber-soft:#fef3c7;
  --red:#dc2626;--red-soft:#fee2e2;--green:#16a34a;--green-soft:#dcfce7;
  --blue:#1d4ed8;--blue-soft:#dbeafe;--violet:#7c3aed;--violet-soft:#ede9fe;
  --orange:#ea580c;--orange-soft:#ffedd5;--slate:#475569;
  --bg:#f0fdfa;--white:#ffffff;--border:#99f6e4;--text:#1e293b;--shadow:rgba(15,118,110,0.09);
}
*{box-sizing:border-box;margin:0;padding:0}html{scroll-behavior:smooth}
body{background:var(--bg);color:var(--text);font-family:'Sarabun',sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:1.7;overflow-x:hidden}
.hero{background:linear-gradient(150deg,#042f2e 0%,var(--teal) 50%,var(--teal3) 100%);padding:44px 20px 64px;position:relative;overflow:hidden}
.hero::after{content:'';position:absolute;bottom:-1px;left:0;right:0;height:40px;background:var(--bg);clip-path:ellipse(58% 100% at 50% 100%)}
.hero::before{content:'';position:absolute;inset:0;background-image:radial-gradient(rgba(255,255,255,0.04) 1px,transparent 1px);background-size:28px 28px}
.hi{position:relative}
.htag{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;background:rgba(255,255,255,0.1);border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.2);color:#99f6e4;font-family:'IBM Plex Mono',monospace;font-size:11px;font-weight:600;padding:5px 14px;border-radius:4px;letter-spacing:1.5px;margin-bottom:14px}
.hero h1{font-family:'Kanit',sans-serif;font-size:24px;font-weight:800;color:#fff;line-height:1.25;margin-bottom:8px}
.hero h1 em{font-style:normal;color:var(--amber2)}
.hero-sub{color:rgba(255,255,255,0.55);font-size:13px;margin-bottom:20px}
.part-chips{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:8px}
.pchip{background:rgba(255,255,255,0.08);border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.15);border-radius:10px;padding:10px 12px}
.pchip-n{font-family:'IBM Plex Mono',monospace;font-size:10px;color:#99f6e4;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:1px;margin-bottom:3px}
.pchip-t{font-family:'Kanit',sans-serif;font-size:12px;font-weight:700;color:#fff}
.pchip-s{font-size:10px;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.5);margin-top:2px}
.sticky-p{position:sticky;top:0;z-index:100;background:var(--white);border-bottom:2px solid var(--border);padding:10px 20px;box-shadow:0 2px 12px var(--shadow)}
.pt{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;margin-bottom:7px;font-family:'IBM Plex Mono',monospace;font-size:11px;color:var(--slate)}
.pt strong{color:var(--teal)}
.pbar{height:6px;background:var(--teal-soft);border-radius:6px;overflow:hidden;margin-bottom:9px}
.pfill{height:100%;background:linear-gradient(90deg,var(--teal),var(--teal3));border-radius:6px;width:0%;transition:width 0.5s ease}
.pills{display:flex;gap:5px;flex-wrap:wrap}
.pill{font-size:10px;font-weight:600;padding:3px 9px;border-radius:20px;border:1.5px solid var(--border);color:var(--slate);background:var(--bg);cursor:pointer;transition:all 0.2s;font-family:'Kanit',sans-serif;user-select:none}
.pill.done{background:var(--teal);color:#99f6e4;border-color:var(--teal)}
.pbanner{padding:14px 20px;color:#fff;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px}
.pbn{background:rgba(255,255,255,0.15);border-radius:6px;padding:5px 12px;font-family:'IBM Plex Mono',monospace;font-size:10px;font-weight:600;color:#99f6e4}
.pbt{font-family:'Kanit',sans-serif;font-size:15px;font-weight:800}
.pbs{font-size:11px;opacity:0.65;margin-top:1px}
.section{padding:24px 20px;opacity:0;transform:translateY(18px);transition:opacity 0.5s ease,transform 0.5s ease}
.section.visible{opacity:1;transform:translateY(0)}
.slbl{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;font-family:'IBM Plex Mono',monospace;font-size:10px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:2px;color:var(--teal2);text-transform:uppercase;margin-bottom:5px}
.slbl::before{content:'';display:block;width:18px;height:2px;background:var(--teal2);border-radius:2px}
.stitle{font-family:'Kanit',sans-serif;font-size:19px;font-weight:800;color:var(--teal);line-height:1.25;margin-bottom:4px}
.sdesc{font-size:13px;color:var(--slate);margin-bottom:18px}
.card{background:var(--white);border-radius:14px;padding:16px;box-shadow:0 2px 14px var(--shadow);border:1px solid var(--border);margin-bottom:12px}
.ctitle{font-family:'Kanit',sans-serif;font-size:14px;font-weight:700;margin-bottom:12px;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px}
.note{background:var(--amber-soft);border-left:4px solid var(--amber);border-radius:0 10px 10px 0;padding:10px 14px;font-size:12px;margin-top:10px}
/* SCM */
.scm-flow{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;flex-wrap:wrap;justify-content:center;padding:10px 0}
.snode{border-radius:10px;padding:10px 12px;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;text-align:center;border:2px solid;min-width:70px;line-height:1.3}
.sarr{font-size:18px;color:var(--teal3)}
.flow-list{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px}
.fi{border-radius:10px;padding:12px 14px;border-left:4px solid;display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:flex-start}
.fi-icon{font-size:22px;flex-shrink:0}
.fi-name{font-family:'Kanit',sans-serif;font-size:13px;font-weight:700}
.fi-desc{font-size:11px;color:var(--slate);margin-top:2px}
/* Stages */
.stages-list{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px}
.stage-item{border-radius:10px;overflow:hidden;box-shadow:0 1px 8px var(--shadow);cursor:pointer}
.stage-head{padding:11px 14px;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center}
.stage-title{font-family:'Kanit',sans-serif;font-size:13px;font-weight:700;color:#fff}
.stage-sub{font-size:11px;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.65);margin-top:2px}
.stage-body{display:none;padding:12px 14px;font-size:12px;line-height:1.7;background:var(--white);border-top:1px solid var(--border)}
.stage-item.open .stage-body{display:block;animation:fadeIn 0.25s}
/* Formulas */
.fbox{background:var(--teal);border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:10px}
.ftitle{font-family:'IBM Plex Mono',monospace;font-size:10px;font-weight:600;color:#99f6e4;letter-spacing:1px;margin-bottom:5px}
.fexpr{font-family:'IBM Plex Mono',monospace;font-size:13px;color:#fff;font-weight:600;line-height:1.7}
.fexpr em{color:var(--amber2);font-style:normal}
/* Calculator */
.cw{background:var(--white);border-radius:14px;padding:16px;box-shadow:0 2px 14px var(--shadow);border:1px solid var(--border)}
.cgrid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:8px;margin-bottom:10px}
.cfield{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:3px}
.cfield label{font-size:11px;font-weight:700;color:var(--teal);font-family:'Kanit',sans-serif}
.cfield input{background:var(--bg);border:2px solid var(--border);border-radius:8px;padding:7px 10px;font-size:13px;font-family:'IBM Plex Mono',monospace;font-weight:600;color:var(--text);outline:none;transition:border-color 0.2s;width:100%}
.cfield input:focus{border-color:var(--teal2)}
.cbtn{background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--teal),var(--teal3));color:#fff;border:none;border-radius:10px;padding:11px;font-family:'Kanit',sans-serif;font-size:14px;font-weight:700;cursor:pointer;width:100%;margin-bottom:10px}
.cresult{background:var(--teal);border-radius:10px;padding:14px;display:none}
.cresult.show{display:block;animation:fadeIn 0.3s}
.rrow{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;padding:5px 0;border-bottom:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.1);font-size:12px}
.rrow:last-child{border-bottom:none}
.rlbl{color:rgba(255,255,255,0.7);font-size:11px}
.rval{font-family:'IBM Plex Mono',monospace;font-weight:700;color:var(--amber2);font-size:14px}
/* ABC */
.abc-grid{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px}
.abc-item{border-radius:10px;padding:12px 14px;display:flex;gap:14px;align-items:center;border:2px solid}
.abc-lbl{font-family:'Kanit',sans-serif;font-size:32px;font-weight:800;flex-shrink:0;width:40px;text-align:center}
.abc-bw{flex:1}
.abc-name{font-family:'Kanit',sans-serif;font-size:12px;font-weight:700;margin-bottom:4px}
.abc-bar{height:12px;border-radius:6px;margin-bottom:3px}
.abc-stat{font-size:10px;font-family:'IBM Plex Mono',monospace}
/* Inventory systems */
.inv-cmp{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:10px}
.inv-card{border-radius:12px;padding:13px;border-top:4px solid}
.inv-t{font-family:'Kanit',sans-serif;font-size:12px;font-weight:800;margin-bottom:8px}
.inv-f{font-size:11px;padding:3px 0 3px 12px;position:relative;border-bottom:1px solid rgba(0,0,0,0.05)}
.inv-f::before{content:'✓';position:absolute;left:0;font-size:10px;font-weight:700}
.inv-f:last-child{border-bottom:none}
/* 7 Wastes */
.waste-list{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:7px}
.wr{display:flex;gap:0;border-radius:10px;overflow:hidden;box-shadow:0 1px 8px var(--shadow);cursor:pointer}
.wl{width:44px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-family:'Kanit',sans-serif;font-size:22px;font-weight:800;color:#fff;flex-shrink:0}
.wi{flex:1;background:var(--white);padding:10px 13px;border-top:1px solid var(--border);border-right:1px solid var(--border);border-bottom:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:0 10px 10px 0}
.wn{font-family:'Kanit',sans-serif;font-size:12px;font-weight:700}
.wt{font-size:11px;color:var(--slate)}
.we{display:none;margin-top:5px;font-size:11px;padding:5px 10px;border-radius:6px;background:var(--teal-soft);color:var(--teal)}
.wr.open .we{display:block}
/* Lean grid */
.lean-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:8px}
.li{background:var(--white);border-radius:10px;padding:12px;border:1px solid var(--border);box-shadow:0 1px 6px var(--shadow);border-left:4px solid;cursor:pointer}
.li-icon{font-size:20px;margin-bottom:5px}
.li-name{font-family:'Kanit',sans-serif;font-size:12px;font-weight:700}
.li-det{display:none;font-size:11px;color:var(--slate);margin-top:5px;line-height:1.5}
.li.open .li-det{display:block;animation:fadeIn 0.25s}
/* Kanban */
.kflow{background:var(--teal);border-radius:12px;padding:16px}
.krow{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;justify-content:center;margin-bottom:10px;flex-wrap:wrap}
.kbox{background:rgba(255,255,255,0.12);border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.2);border-radius:8px;padding:8px 12px;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;color:#fff;text-align:center}
.kcard{background:var(--amber);border-radius:4px;padding:3px 8px;font-size:9px;font-weight:700;color:#fff;font-family:'IBM Plex Mono',monospace}
.karr{color:#99f6e4;font-size:14px}
.klbl{font-size:11px;color:#99f6e4;font-family:'Kanit',sans-serif;font-weight:600;text-align:center}
/* ERP */
.erp-mods{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr 1fr;gap:7px}
.emod{border-radius:8px;padding:10px 8px;text-align:center;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;border:2px solid}
.eflow{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;justify-content:center;flex-wrap:wrap;font-size:12px;font-weight:700;margin-bottom:12px}
.efbox{border-radius:8px;padding:8px 12px;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;border:2px solid;text-align:center}
.efarr{color:var(--slate);font-size:16px}
/* Case */
.case-wrap{background:var(--white);border-radius:14px;overflow:hidden;box-shadow:0 4px 18px var(--shadow)}
.case-head{padding:14px 18px;color:#fff}
.case-head h4{font-family:'Kanit',sans-serif;font-size:14px;font-weight:700}
.case-head p{font-size:11px;opacity:0.7;margin-top:2px}
.case-body{padding:14px 18px}
.cscen{background:var(--bg);border-left:4px solid var(--teal2);border-radius:0 10px 10px 0;padding:12px 14px;font-size:12px;line-height:1.7;margin-bottom:12px}
.cqt{font-family:'Kanit',sans-serif;font-size:12px;font-weight:700;padding:9px 13px;border-radius:8px;cursor:pointer;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;margin-bottom:5px}
.ca{display:none;padding:10px 13px;font-size:12px;line-height:1.7;border-radius:8px;margin-bottom:7px}
.ca.open{display:block;animation:fadeIn 0.3s}
/* Quiz */
.quiz-section{background:linear-gradient(160deg,#042f2e,var(--teal));padding:26px 20px 40px}
.quiz-header{text-align:center;margin-bottom:18px}
.quiz-header h3{font-family:'Kanit',sans-serif;font-size:20px;font-weight:800;color:#fff}
.quiz-header p{color:rgba(255,255,255,0.5);font-size:12px;margin-top:4px}
.qcard{background:var(--white);border-radius:12px;padding:14px;margin-bottom:10px}
.qnum{display:inline-block;background:var(--teal2);color:#fff;font-family:'Kanit',sans-serif;font-size:10px;font-weight:800;padding:2px 10px;border-radius:20px;margin-bottom:7px}
.qtext{font-family:'Kanit',sans-serif;font-size:13px;font-weight:700;color:var(--text);margin-bottom:10px;line-height:1.5}
.qopts{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:6px}
.qopt{background:var(--bg);border:2px solid var(--border);border-radius:8px;padding:8px 12px;font-size:12px;cursor:pointer;transition:all 0.2s;text-align:left;font-family:'Sarabun',sans-serif}
.qopt:hover:not(:disabled){border-color:var(--teal2);background:var(--teal-soft)}
.qopt.correct{background:var(--green-soft);border-color:var(--green);color:#14532d;font-weight:700}
.qopt.wrong{background:var(--red-soft);border-color:var(--red);color:#7f1d1d}
.qopt.show-correct{background:var(--green-soft);border-color:var(--green)}
.qfb{display:none;margin-top:7px;padding:7px 12px;border-radius:8px;font-size:12px}
.qfb.show{display:block}
.qfb.ok{background:var(--green-soft);color:#14532d}
.qfb.fail{background:var(--red-soft);color:#7f1d1d}
.sbox{display:none;background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--teal2),var(--teal3));border-radius:14px;padding:22px;text-align:center}
.sbox.show{display:block;animation:fadeIn 0.4s}
.sbox h3{font-family:'Kanit',sans-serif;font-size:18px;font-weight:800;color:#fff}
.sbig{font-family:'Kanit',sans-serif;font-size:50px;font-weight:800;color:var(--amber2);line-height:1;margin:6px 0}
.smsg{font-size:13px;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.85)}
.rbtn{background:#fff;color:var(--teal);border:none;font-family:'Kanit',sans-serif;font-size:13px;font-weight:700;padding:9px 26px;border-radius:20px;cursor:pointer;margin-top:12px}
.bg-white{background:var(--white)}.bg-soft{background:var(--bg)}
.divider{height:2px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,transparent,var(--border),transparent);margin:0 20px}
@keyframes fadeIn{from{opacity:0;transform:translateY(-5px)}to{opacity:1;transform:translateY(0)}}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="hero">
  <div class="hi">
    <div class="htag">BA6500 · NIDA EMBA · MODULE 4</div>
    <h1>SCM · Inventory · <em>Lean</em> · ERP</h1>
    <div class="hero-sub">ผศ.ดร.ชัยรัช หิรัญยะวะสิต · 4 Parts · Interactive Study Guide</div>
    <div class="part-chips">
      <div class="pchip"><div class="pchip-n">4(1)</div><div class="pchip-t">Supply Chain Management</div><div class="pchip-s">4 Flows · 4 Stages · Hub & Spoke</div></div>
      <div class="pchip"><div class="pchip-n">4(2)</div><div class="pchip-t">Inventory Management</div><div class="pchip-s">⚡ EOQ · ROP · Safety Stock · ABC</div></div>
      <div class="pchip"><div class="pchip-n">4(3)</div><div class="pchip-t">Lean Manufacturing & JIT</div><div class="pchip-s">7 Wastes · Kanban · 5S · Kaizen</div></div>
      <div class="pchip"><div class="pchip-n">4(4)</div><div class="pchip-t">ERP System</div><div class="pchip-s">MRP · MPS · Integrated Planning</div></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="sticky-p">
  <div class="pt"><strong>MODULE 4 — Progress</strong><span id="pct">0%</span></div>
  <div class="pbar"><div class="pfill" id="pfill"></div></div>
  <div class="pills">
    <div class="pill" onclick="tick(this,'t1')">SCM Concept</div><div class="pill" onclick="tick(this,'t2')">4 Flows</div><div class="pill" onclick="tick(this,'t3')">4 Stages</div><div class="pill" onclick="tick(this,'t4')">EOQ สูตร</div><div class="pill" onclick="tick(this,'t5')">ROP+Safety</div><div class="pill" onclick="tick(this,'t6')">ABC</div><div class="pill" onclick="tick(this,'t7')">7 Wastes</div><div class="pill" onclick="tick(this,'t8')">Lean Tools</div><div class="pill" onclick="tick(this,'t9')">Kanban/JIT</div><div class="pill" onclick="tick(this,'t10')">ERP/MRP</div><div class="pill" onclick="tick(this,'t11')">Quiz ✓</div>
  </div>
</div>

<!-- PART 4(1) SCM -->
<div class="pbanner" style="background:linear-gradient(135deg,#042f2e,var(--teal))">
  <div><div class="pbn">PART 4(1)</div><div class="pbt">Supply Chain Management & Logistics</div><div class="pbs">การบริหารห่วงโซ่อุปทาน</div></div>
</div>

<div class="section bg-white" id="s1">
  <div class="slbl">01 — SCM Foundation</div>
  <div class="stitle">What is SCM? + 4 Flows</div>
  <div class="sdesc">SCM = บริหารการไหลของข้อมูล วัตถุดิบ สินค้า บริการ และเงินสด จาก Supplier ถึง Customer อย่างเป็นระบบ</div>
  <div class="card">
    <div class="ctitle" style="color:var(--teal)">🔗 Supply Chain Structure</div>
    <div class="scm-flow">
      <div class="snode" style="background:#f0fdfa;border-color:var(--teal2);color:var(--teal)">SUPPLIERS</div>
      <div class="sarr">→</div>
      <div class="snode" style="background:var(--teal);color:#fff;border-color:var(--teal)">MANU-<br>FACTURERS</div>
      <div class="sarr">→</div>
      <div class="snode" style="background:var(--amber-soft);border-color:var(--amber);color:#92400e">DISTRI-<br>BUTORS</div>
      <div class="sarr">→</div>
      <div class="snode" style="background:var(--violet-soft);border-color:var(--violet);color:var(--violet)">RETAILERS</div>
      <div class="sarr">→</div>
      <div class="snode" style="background:var(--green-soft);border-color:var(--green);color:var(--green)">CUSTOMERS</div>
    </div>
    <div class="note"><strong style="color:var(--amber)">Win-Win Strategy:</strong> ลูกค้าได้สินค้าดีราคาแข่งขัน + Supplier/Manufacturer/Retailer ได้ธุรกิจระยะยาวที่มีกำไร — เป็นไปไม่ได้ที่คนเดียวจะกำไรในขณะที่คนอื่นขาดทุน</div>
  </div>
  <div class="card">
    <div class="ctitle" style="color:var(--teal)">🔄 4 Flows ใน SCM</div>
    <div class="flow-list">
      <div class="fi" style="background:#f0fdfa;border-color:var(--teal2)"><div class="fi-icon">📦</div><div><div class="fi-name" style="color:var(--teal)">Material, Product & Service Flow</div><div class="fi-desc">วัตถุดิบ/สินค้าไหลไปข้างหน้า Supplier → Customer</div></div></div>
      <div class="fi" style="background:var(--blue-soft);border-color:var(--blue)"><div class="fi-icon">💻</div><div><div class="fi-name" style="color:var(--blue)">Information Flow</div><div class="fi-desc">ข้อมูล Order, Forecast, Inventory — ขาดข้อมูลที่ถูกต้อง = ปัญหาทั้งระบบ</div></div></div>
      <div class="fi" style="background:var(--amber-soft);border-color:var(--amber)"><div class="fi-icon">🤝</div><div><div class="fi-name" style="color:#92400e">Collaborative Planning Flow</div><div class="fi-desc">วางแผนร่วมกัน — Product Dev, Production Scheduling, Demand Planning, Logistics</div></div></div>
      <div class="fi" style="background:var(--green-soft);border-color:var(--green)"><div class="fi-icon">💰</div><div><div class="fi-name" style="color:var(--green)">Cash Flow</div><div class="fi-desc">การชำระเงินไหลจาก Customer ย้อนกลับตลอดห่วงโซ่</div></div></div>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="card">
    <div class="ctitle" style="color:var(--teal)">🏗️ Hub & Spoke vs Traditional</div>
