  <div class="fbox"><div class="ftitle">① EOQ — Economic Order Quantity</div><div class="fexpr">Q* = √( <em>2DS</em> / <em>H</em> )</div></div>
  <div class="fbox"><div class="ftitle">② TOTAL ANNUAL COST (TC)</div><div class="fexpr">TC = <em>DC</em> + (<em>D/Q</em>)×<em>S</em> + (<em>Q/2</em>)×<em>H</em></div></div>
  <div class="fbox"><div class="ftitle">③ REORDER POINT (ROP) — ไม่มี Safety Stock</div><div class="fexpr">R = <em>d</em> × <em>L</em></div></div>
  <div class="fbox" style="margin-bottom:14px"><div class="ftitle">④ SAFETY STOCK + ROP</div><div class="fexpr">B = <em>Z × σ</em>    →    R = <em>d×L</em> + <em>B</em></div></div>
  <div style="background:var(--amber-soft);border-radius:10px;padding:12px 14px;font-size:12px;margin-bottom:14px;border-left:4px solid var(--amber)">
    <strong style="color:var(--amber)">Variables:</strong> D=Annual Demand · S=Order/Setup Cost · H=Holding Cost/unit/yr · C=Cost/unit · d=Daily demand · L=Lead time · Z=Z-score (95%=1.65) · σ=Std dev
  </div>
